      "text": [
        "Physiotherapy tailored to your injury",
        "From pitch-side sprains to years of nagging back pain, our chartered physiotherapists design a plan around your body and your goals.",
        "Sports Injury Rehabilitation",
        "Ligament sprains, muscle tears, tendinopathies and post-surgery rehab for runners, footballers, rugby players and gym-goers across Surrey.",
        "Back & Neck Pain",
        "Evidence-based treatment for lower back pain, sciatica, disc issues and neck stiffness caused by desk work, driving or poor posture.",
        "Joint & Muscle Pain",
        "Targeted treatment for shoulder impingement, knee pain, hip pain and repetitive strain injuries affecting work and daily life.",
        "Post-Surgery Rehabilitation",
        "Structured recovery programmes following knee, hip, shoulder and spinal surgery, built in coordination with your surgeon.",
        "Sports Massage",
        "Deep tissue and sports massage to relieve muscle tension, speed up recovery and reduce the risk of future injury.",
        "Movement & Injury Screening",
        "Full biomechanical assessments to identify weaknesses before they become injuries — popular with runners and club athletes.",
        "What We Treat"
      ]
